--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Alcance / Scope
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This license covers ONLY the original source code of VIUrewards in this
repository (the TypeScript/JavaScript sources, the dashboard and overlay
assets in web/ and overlay/, the build and packaging scripts in scripts/, and
the documentation in docs/), except where a file states otherwise.

It does NOT cover, and does NOT replace, the licenses of third-party
components:

- npm dependencies listed in package.json / package-lock.json keep their own
  licenses; copies are collected into licenses/ in the distribution package.
- SQLite, embedded in the better-sqlite3 native binding, is in the public
  domain.
- Node.js, yt-dlp, FFmpeg and ffprobe are separate programs. They are NOT
  redistributed in this repository's distribution package: the installer
  downloads them from each vendor and keeps each vendor notice next to the
  installed binaries. See docs/distribution.md.

